WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.260
ALLIM is one calm space for recitation, understanding, and keeping the Qur’an in the heart. The journey begins with a single ayah: clearly, attentively, and without distraction.

00:00:12.100 --> 00:00:25.440
In recitation mode, the system listens word by word. Correct words open in sequence. A mistake pauses the reading, and the next ayah opens only after the word is corrected.

00:00:25.280 --> 00:00:40.760
Qur’an in the Heart is a clear system of three hundred repetitions. Every accepted recitation updates the live counter. One hundred builds the first stage, another hundred strengthens it, and the final hundred secures the ayah.

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:52.310
The Madinah Mushaf preserves the familiar visual pattern of the page. Choose the paper and ink, listen to renowned Qur’an reciters, and reveal interlinear meaning when you need it.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:01:03.960
Tafsir. Arabic text and translation remain beside the source. This helps you see how one ayah explains another while staying grounded in verified scholarship.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:15.630
The Academy brings together a personal plan, online courses, and guided study with a teacher. The basic cabinet helps you begin; full access supports systematic learning.

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:23.920
ALLIM. Learn the Book. Reflect. Keep it in your heart, and live by it.
